OL,3,GNEWSAI couldn't breathe, says suspect
OL,4,Aheld in headlock and punched by PC
OL,5,Aduring arrest
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has told a police misconduct
OL,8,Fhearing how he "couldn't breathe" as
OL,9,Fofficers pinned him to the ground when
OL,10,Fthey tried to arrest him.
OL,12,FPolice attempted to arrest Steven Clark
OL,13,Fin Porthmadog, Gwynedd, when he ended
OL,14,Fup on the grass in a headlock, with one
OL,15,Fofficer punching him nine times in the
OL,16,Fhead, the hearing was told.
OL,18,FPC Richard Williams denies eight
OL,19,Fallegations of using unreasonable
OL,20,Fforce.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
